flowchart LR
  A["`**once(fn () => ...)**
  is called`"] --> B["`Build the key:
  file + line + method
  + captured variables`"]
  B --> C{"`Called inside
  an object?`"}
  C -- "yes" --> D["`Stored on **that instance**
  (WeakMap: freed with the object)`"]
  C -- "no: static or function" --> E["`Stored in **one global bucket**
  for the whole process`"]
  D --> F{"`Key already
  stored?`"}
  E --> F
  F -- "yes" --> G["`Return the cached value
  **closure skipped**`"]
  F -- "no" --> H["`Run the closure,
  store the result`"]
  E -.-> I["`Cleared by Octane and tests.
  **Not** between queue jobs:
  add Queue::before(Once::flush)`"]
